        },
        {
          "word": " were.",
          "start": 669.25,
          "end": 669.8,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "We got ourselves out by being interested in Satan's theory that others besides God can have power.",
