          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Quran.",
          "start": 781.53,
          "end": 782.53,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Most people, no matter what you do, will not believe.",
