    {
      "text": "[29:17]  \"What you idolize besides GOD are idols from your creation; you.\" Whatever idols you set up possess no provisions for you. Therefore, seek provisions only from GOD. Worship Him alone, and be appreciative of Him; to Him will be your return.",
