          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "While the Arabic says (\u0641\u0650\u0649 \u0643\u064e\u0628\u064e\u062f\u064d). FI (\u0641\u0650\u0649) means \"in.\"",
