          "speaker": "Edip"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "[83:36]  Most assuredly, the disbelievers are requited for what they did.",
      "start": 4859.52,
      "end": 4864.44,
      "speaker": "Edip",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " [83:36]",
          "start": 4859.52,
